chosen.how_to_run:
Step 1, Apify actor shahidirfan/Workindia-Jobs-Scraper (0.0005 start + 0.001 per post), includeDetails=true so the employer's own contact_detail, branch_company_name, branch_address, interview_details and job_published_on_platform are returned. Four runs:
{"keyword":"clinic","city":"ahmedabad","results_wanted":25,"max_pages":3,"includeDetails":true}
{"keyword":"dental","city":"ahmedabad","results_wanted":15,"max_pages":2,"includeDetails":true}
{"keyword":"clinic","city":"gandhinagar","results_wanted":20,"max_pages":2,"includeDetails":true}
{"keyword":"clinic","city":"mehsana","results_wanted":15,"max_pages":2,"includeDetails":true}
Total 75 posts, about 0.077 USD. Set max total charge 0.09 USD.
Step 2, keep a post only if: job_published_on_platform / created_at is within 90 days of 2026-10-26 (prefer 30); branch_company_name is an independent clinic (not a hospital, chain, staffing firm or consultancy); the role is receptionist, front desk, telecaller, patient coordinator, dental assistant (appointment duties), computer operator, or digital marketing / social media executive; the location is in one of the three cities; is_expired is false.
Step 3, free web checks (WebSearch only): (a) one query per survivor, "<clinic name> <area> <city>", to confirm the clinic exists, has no own website, and is not a chain; (b) gap filling for sources the actor misses: site:apna.co "dental" Gandhinagar assistant OR receptionist; site:apna.co clinic Mehsana; site:baputalk.com receptionist Gujarat; site:in.indeed.com Dental-Clinic-jobs Ahmedabad. Read only the snippets and result pages that load (plain fetch of WorkIndia and Indeed returns 403).
If Apify returns few rows, add Indeed with unfenced-group/indeed-in-scraper: {"query":"clinic receptionist","location":"Gandhinagar","radius":25,"fromDays":"14","sort":"date","maxItems":15} (0.001 start + 0.00076 per job; its output has companyName, corporateWebsite, datePublished, jobUrl), repeated for Ahmedabad and Mehsana.
